<title>USA: Global enters international market.</title>
<headline>Global enters international market.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global TeleMedia International Inc said on Thursday it entered the international marketplace.</p>
<p>GTMI is a certified carrier possessing its Federal Communications Corporation (FCC) 214 International Operating Authority.</p>
<p>GTMI has secured to provide international termination services to three upper tier nationwide carriers and has targeted the first quarter of 1997 to launch its international marketing efforts.</p>
</text>
